	(text "Control-side pin assignment; AON = 3.3 V. Match the mating Power board before PCB release."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 23 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "06330826-2f8f-4a88-8cb7-a81e92c1b1db")
	)
	(text "J400 - rails and supervisor signals"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 40 73.66 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0bff409c-fb9b-4d94-adf3-58d0117336f1")
	)
	(text "AON is 3.3 V and starts before SYS3V3/IO3V3. VTT must source and\nsink at DDR1V35/2; DDR_VREF is a quiet reference at the same\nnominal level. P15/N15 and PROG_P15/PROG_N15 are separate analog\ndomains. Signal mapping is defined here, not inferred from a\nmissing mating board."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 110.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "33cad342-f851-4a17-ace7-38c622cc23a6")
	)
	(text "Inputs from Power are 3.3 V logic. PG/permit default low; UART defaults high.\nHOST_RESET_N is driven only by an open-drain reset source. MATRIX_INHIBIT_N is\nan open-drain return to Power with an AON pull-up here. Watchdog/alive default low."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 263 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1 1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "42201c55-02e2-4c5d-86a1-862480d45445")
	)
	(text "Shared Power permit is received independently\nin SYS3V3 and IO3V3; these output nets are not shorted."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.45 181.61 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.1 1.1)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "4cc96f1b-7960-4b39-a66a-cb979eb6e456")
	)
	(text "IO3V3 permit receiver"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 175.26 144.78 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "6ee7552b-c8f0-48a2-8671-4ee1c43632e4")
	)
	(text "Separate receiving domains"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 61.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "81ccdb17-f10b-4aca-9884-a5c6d7a74a05")
	)
	(text "Power and supervision interface"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 14.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.8 1.8)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "8936ad07-e381-4d40-8e37-15cfb659034a")
	)
	(text "U400 uses SYS3V3 for the MCU-side power-good, permit and UART\nsignals. U401 uses IO3V3 for the matrix logic. Both Nexperia\ndevices specify Ioff, so an AON-powered supervisor does not\ndrive a disabled receiver domain through its outputs."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 67.5 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "b6123f4b-9a1e-4c6d-86ee-e5bfffc27de2")
	)
	(text "Permission and hardware inhibit"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 81.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "c468df66-5f9f-47fb-8fde-5842c1f9ba5c")
	)
	(text "J400 connects the external supplies to Control. Parallel\nCORE1V0, IO3V3, DDR1V35 and GND contacts provide an explicit\nroute; their final current rating, mating height and return\ngeometry must be checked against the Power board. A generic 2.54\nmm 2x32 footprint defines this Control-side prototype interface."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 45 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "d0db9c8e-ea9d-42b4-8a6c-d9d4cf4445b7")
	)
	(text "Power rails are physical inputs"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 39 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e1936664-11d3-4115-a652-85658332a663")
	)
	(text "Required supply contract"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 104.4 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.45 1.45)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e1a28db9-23cc-431f-9f6f-8c5a75827062")
	)
	(text "MATRIX_PERMIT_POWER is the common supervisor permission. Its two\nbuffered outputs remain separate nets. The matrix receiver is\npulled low on sheet 1300. MAT_FAULT_Q produces MATRIX_INHIBIT_N\nthrough Q2203; the new connector now exposes that output to the\nPower supervisor."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 315 87.9 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.15 1.15)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e295534e-49ba-4acd-a4bb-3e2086679db3")
	)
	(text "SYS3V3 receivers: powered-off isolation"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 171.45 36.83 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.3 1.3)
				(color 0 70 160 1)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "e53296a1-4209-483b-85e9-d876bc60ca90")
	)
	(text "Default states and open-drain supervision"
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 22.86 193.04 0)
		(effects
